根\u003C/strong> \u003Cp uimix-text=\"y500pro-wifi-6\">天线数量\u003C/p> \u003C/li> \n       \u003Cli class=\"umx-li3\"> \u003Cstrong uimix-text=\"y500pro-wifi-7\" class=\"umx-str-36\">90%\u003C/strong> \u003Cp uimix-text=\"y500pro-wifi-8\">中框天线占比\u003C/p> \u003C/li> \n       \u003Cli class=\"umx-li4\"> \u003Cstrong uimix-text=\"y500pro-wifi-9\" class=\"umx-str-36\">118%\u003Csup>24\u003C/sup>\u003C/strong> \u003Cp uimix-text=\"y500pro-wifi-10\">信号强度至高提升\u003C/p> \u003C/li> \n       \u003Cli class=\"umx-li5\"> \u003Cstrong uimix-text=\"y500pro-wifi-11\" class=\"umx-str-36\">60.3%\u003Csup>24\u003C/sup>\u003C/strong> \u003Cp uimix-text=\"y500pro-wifi-12\">信号强度平均提升\u003C/p> \u003C/li> \n      \u003C/ul> \n     \u003C/div> \n     \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure umx-figure2 umx-data-speed\"> \n      \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-bg2 lazy-imageom\">\u003C/figure> \n      \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-mb-con\"> \n       \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-icon1 lazy-imageom\">\u003C/div> \n       \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-txt\"> \n        \u003Cp uimix-text=\"y500pro-wifi-15\" class=\"umx-p1\">全新低频天线设计\u003C/p> \n        \u003Cp uimix-text=\"y500pro-wifi-16\" class=\"umx-p2\">更大口径，更大辐射面积，更可靠的结构，信号更强更稳定。\u003C/p> \n       \u003C/div> \n      \u003C/div> \n     \u003C/div> \n     \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure umx-figure3 umx-data-speed\"> \n      \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-bg3 lazy-imageom\">\u003C/figure> \n      \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-mb-con\"> \n       \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-icon2 lazy-imageom\">\u003C/div> \n       \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-txt\"> \n        \u003Cp uimix-text=\"y500pro-wifi-17\" class=\"umx-p1\">AI 网络智选\u003Cbr class=\"umx-mb-hide\">优选好信号\u003C/p> \n        \u003Cp uimix-text=\"y500pro-wifi-18\" class=\"umx-p2\">抢信号快人一步。\u003C/p> \n       \u003C/div> \n      \u003C/div> \n     \u003C/div> \n     \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure umx-figure4 umx-data-speed\"> \n      \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-bg4 lazy-imageom\">\u003C/figure> \n      \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-mb-con\"> \n       \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-icon3 lazy-